Meanwhile mixed last barite batch for STB spud can.  
</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2008-10-08T16:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2008-10-08T17:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed SJA meeting with all involved personnel prior to leak test surface lines, and rate test Grizzly pumps combined with the Cmt unit.

