</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2008-10-08T19:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2008-10-08T20:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Held tool box talk with night shift prior to commence leak testing of the surface lines, and pump rate measurements of Grizzly pumps and Cmt Unit.
</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2008-10-08T20:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2008-10-08T20:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Flushed the lines to the Grizzly pumps.
</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2008-10-08T20:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2008-10-08T21:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Leak tested Grizzly pumps surface lines 35 bars 5min, increased pressure to 360 bars, observed minor leak at T piece in Moon Pool. Bled down pressure and tightened T piece.
</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2008-10-08T21:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2008-10-08T21:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Leak tested line to 360 bars 10 min. Closed Lo-torq at pop-off, attempted to leak test line to 380 bars. Found minor leak in line at cantilever. Bled off pressure and tightened Weco connection. Leak tested line to 380 bars 10min.
</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2008-10-08T21:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2008-10-08T22:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Lined up and leak tested line from Cmt unit to X-max tree. 35/360bars 5/10mins. Bled off pressure.
</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2008-10-08T22:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2008-10-08T22:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Opened the Swab valve, HMV and applied pressure to the DHSV control line. 
</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2008-10-08T22:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2008-10-08T23:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Commenced pumping with the two Grizzly pumps at 500 lpm each pump. DHSV opened at 100 bars. Increased pump rate to 1000 lpm each pump. WH pressure 110 bars. Started pumping with the Cmt unit, pressure picked up to 135bars within a few minutes. Shut down the Cmt unit, observed that pressure dropped to 110 bars with 2000 lpm from the Grizzly pumps.
</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2008-10-08T23:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2008-10-09T00:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Investigated the pressure drop and found air trapped in suction line. Flushed suctions from Utsira manifold. Started pumping again. Lost suction when picking up the rate from 750 to 1000 lpm each pump. Opened fluid ends on Grizzly pumps and flushed manifolds. Made new attempt to pick up rate to 1000 lpm each pump, with same negative result as above.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity>
</witsml:drillReport>
